  "2026-10-02T18:23:14.698Z",pi-land-a,"Merge-readiness verification pass by pi-land-a (fleet PR landing session): exact head 087fe1a is up to date with origin/main (merge-base equals main tip), mergeable and CLEAN; Node 22/26 and CodeQL CI are green; the sole review thread is resolved and CodeRabbit's full review of this head completed with no new actionable findings (pm-ado#15 issuecomment-5864301010). Sourcery's weekly budget is exhausted (quota notice, not a review); Greptile and Gemini are not active on this repository."
  "2026-10-02T21:02:41.234Z",pi-grok,"author=pi-grok,text=Fixed cubic empty ?/# delimiter mapping and CodeRabbit omitted-orgUrl silent unmap. Both exported functions now throw TypeError when orgUrl is not a string, and raw ? or # rejects the target before WHATWG parsing drops an empty search or hash. Tagged breaking. Changelog scripts and release.yml pass --breaking-changes so the next dated release records the signature break. Calendar versioning has no semver major; version stays 2026.9.2 until the release workflow cuts the next date. prepare-merge-driver ENOENT finding refused: launcher must stay byte-identical to published pm-ops 2026.9.28; tracked upstream as pm-ops#135."
  "2026-10-02T21:10:57.355Z",pi-grok,"npm run release:check passed on this worktree: 122 tests, coverage 100/100/100/100 across 4 sources, docstring 37/37, production audit 0, changelog:check up to date with --breaking-changes. pm health --strict-exit --require-merge-drivers ok. bun install --no-save reported no package changes; the generated bun.lock is not tracked and was not committed."
